{
  "$schema": "../../../schemas/lesson.schema.json",
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "id": "embedded.input.debounce-01",
  "title": "按键消抖状态机",
  "track": "embedded",
  "language": "c",
  "questionType": "programming",
  "difficulty": "intermediate",
  "summary": "把带抖动的 GPIO 采样转换成稳定的按键状态。",
  "prerequisites": ["c.pointer.swap-01"],
  "knowledge": ["gpio", "state-machine", "sampling", "debounce"],
  "target": "simulator",
  "starter": "starter",
  "statement": "README.md",
  "build": {
    "standard": "c11",
    "sources": ["debounce.c"],
    "tests": ["test_debounce.c"],
    "includeDirs": ["."],
    "timeoutSeconds": 5
  },
  "hints": [
    "只有连续多次采样值相同时，才改变稳定状态。",
    "采样值改变时，将 candidate_state 更新为新值，并把 consecutive_count 设为 1。",
    "当计数达到 threshold 时提交候选状态，然后把计数清零。"
  ],
